{"ticker":"WY","updated":"2026-10-24T00:36:55Z","profile":{"longName":"Weyerhaeuser Company","shortName":"Weyerhaeuser Company","sector":"Real Estate","industry":"REIT - Specialty","country":"United States","website":"https://www.weyerhaeuser.com","fullTimeEmployees":9500,"marketCap":14047144960,"trailingPE":28.661764,"forwardPE":33.05687,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.0500796,"pegRatio":1.86,"targetMeanPrice":27.36364,"targetHighPrice":34.0,"targetLowPrice":21.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":11,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":-0.009,"earningsGrowth":0.871,"grossMargins":0.14507,"operatingMargins":0.080340005,"profitMargins":0.06888,"totalRevenue":6851999744,"beta":0.933,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":27.75,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":18.26,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":4.24},"summary":"Weyerhaeuser Company, one of the world's largest private owners of timberlands, began operations in 1900 and today owns or controls more than 10 million acres of timberlands in the U.S., as well as additional public timberlands managed under long-term licenses in Canada. Weyerhaeuser has been a global leader in sustainability for more than a century and manages 100 percent of its timberlands on a fully sustainable basis in compliance with internationally recognized sustainable forestry standards. Weyerhaeuser is also one of the largest manufacturers of wood products in North America and operates additional business lines around product distribution, climate solutions, real estate, energy and natural resources, among others. In 2025, the company generated 6.9 billion dollar in net sales and employed approximately 9,500 people who serve customers worldwide. Weyerhaeuser Company was founded in 1900 and was incorporated in Washington.","summary_zh":"Weyerhaeuser Company 是世界上最大的私人林地所有者之一，於 1900 年開始運營，如今在美國擁有或控制超過 1000 萬英畝的林地，以及在加拿大根據長期許可管理的其他公共林地。一個多世紀以來，惠好公司一直是永續發展領域的全球領導者，並按照國際公認的永續林業標準，在完全永續的基礎上管理其 100% 的林地。惠好公司也是北美最大的木製品製造商之一，並在產品分銷、氣候解決方案、房地產、能源和自然資源